<%# What the board frame shows between the shell painting and #board answering.

    Shaped like the view it stands in for — User-view rows (a title line, two
    lines of status, a row of buttons), or a grid of cards for the flat and
    Ranked views — so the swap to real content moves nothing above it and
    little below it. Widths vary because a column of identical bars reads as a
    broken layout rather than as loading.

    Carries no ids and no data-live-region, for the reason the transcript
    skeleton gives: the reconnect backfill reconciles by id, and a skeleton that
    answered to a live region's id could replace real rows with grey bars.

    Locals:
      view_mode - the view the shell resolved, so the skeleton takes its shape %>
<div role="status" aria-busy="true" aria-label="Loading sessions" data-board-skeleton>
  <span class="sr-only">Loading sessions…</span>
  <% if view_mode == SessionsController::VIEW_MODE_USER %>
    <div class="mb-4 space-y-2 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none">
      <div class="h-5 w-32 rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
      <div class="h-3 w-full max-w-xl rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="divide-y divide-gray-100 rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white">
      <% %w[w-2/3 w-1/2 w-3/4 w-2/5 w-3/5 w-1/2].each do |title_width| %>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 px-3 py-3 sm:gap-3 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none">
          <div class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <div class="h-4 <%= title_width %> rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
              <div class="h-4 w-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-100"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="h-3 w-full rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
            <div class="h-3 w-4/5 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
            <div class="flex gap-2 pt-1">
              <div class="h-6 w-16 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
              <div class="h-7 w-20 rounded-md bg-gray-100"></div>
              <div class="h-7 w-20 rounded-md bg-gray-100"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  <% else %>
    <div class="mb-3 h-5 w-48 rounded bg-gray-200 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none"></div>
    <div class="<%= session_card_grid_classes %>">
      <% %w[w-3/4 w-1/2 w-2/3 w-3/5 w-4/5 w-1/2].each do |title_width| %>
        <div class="h-48 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 animate-pulse motion-reduce:animate-none">
          <div class="h-4 <%= title_width %> rounded bg-gray-200"></div>
          <div class="mt-3 h-3 w-24 rounded-full bg-gray-100"></div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-2">
            <div class="h-3 w-full rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
            <div class="h-3 w-5/6 rounded bg-gray-100"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
